required_open_webui_version: 0.11.0
description: List an exact requested count of a YouTube channel's newest public uploads when available. Accepts a channel URL, @handle, or channel ID. Uses the official YouTube Data API uploads playlist and returns concise title-and-URL or URL-only output.
requirements: requests
